Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.53,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}It is a remarkable story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.53,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这是一段非凡的故事。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:31.13,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}He's done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.70,0:00:31.13,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:37.22,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs38}And he wins over Feliciano Lopez in dominant form.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:37.22,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他强势击败费利西亚诺·洛佩斯。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:57.68,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}The defending champion is out here in Madrid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:57.68,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}卫冕冠军在马德里被淘汰。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:03.10,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs35}Kei Nishikori scores his first ever win over Roger Federer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.96,0:01:03.10,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}锦织圭首次击败费德勒。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:07.90,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs32}Certainly his finest win on a clay court, of the Japanese player.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.10,0:01:07.90,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这是他红土赛场最出色的胜利。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:12.88,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Game, set, match, Nishikori.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.72,0:01:12.88,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}局、盘、比赛，锦织圭获胜。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:28.65,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Nishikori makes history in Barcelona.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:28.65,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}锦织圭在巴塞罗那创造历史。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.84,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}One hour and 47 minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:13.84,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}1小时47分，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.76,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}and we have a new champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:15.76,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}新冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.84,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Kei Nishikori.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.76,0:02:16.84,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}锦织圭。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:44.98,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Victory for Nishikori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.44,0:02:44.98,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}锦织圭获胜！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.08,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}And what a way to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.99,0:02:47.08,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这样的夺冠方式，太精彩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.24,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Nishikori wins Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.26,0:03:06.24,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}锦织圭赢下华盛顿冠军。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:50.88,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}And with that volley,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:50.88,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}凭借这记截击，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.53,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Nishikori broke at five-all in the fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.53,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}决胜盘5比5，锦织圭破发。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.39,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}This was match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.22,0:03:55.39,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这是赛点。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:04:00.53,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}And Kei Nishikori, with that going in the net,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.96,0:04:00.53,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}随着这一球下网，锦织圭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.44,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}finds himself in the semifinals
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:02.44,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他晋级半决赛，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.84,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}for the second time in three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.84,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这是三年内第二次。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:08.08,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}upsetting Andy Murray, seven-five in the fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.84,0:04:08.08,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}击败安迪·穆雷，决胜盘七比五。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:31.35,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}The drought is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.23,0:04:31.35,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}冠军荒结束了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:35.37,chapter-01_English,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}Two sets to one: 6-4, 3-6, 6-2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.35,0:04:35.37,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}两盘比一：6比4、3比6、6比2。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.09,0:00:03.19,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}十八岁拿下第一座巡回赛冠军。锦织圭，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.51,0:00:06.03,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}把亚洲男子网球带向了更远的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.33,0:00:39.37,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}东京、孟菲斯、巴塞罗那。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.83,0:00:41.19,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}从第一座到第十二座，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:42.15,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}每一次捧杯，
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.39,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}都有自己的重量。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.77,0:01:57.90,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}费德勒、纳达尔、德约科维奇，
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.08,0:01:58.78,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他都赢过。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.24,0:02:00.15,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}美网击败德约，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.32,0:02:01.79,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}让他走进大满贯决赛。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.61,0:02:03.62,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}决赛没能夺冠，
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.84,0:02:07.25,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs42}但他成为了首位晋级大满贯男单决赛的亚洲球员。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.69,0:03:42.70,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}里约拿下铜牌。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.16,0:03:44.18,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}同年回到纽约，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.46,0:03:45.41,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他再进四强。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.86,0:03:47.15,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}那些漫长的第五盘，
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:48.74,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}他从不轻易交出去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.25,0:04:09.23,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}伤病让他停下，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.42,0:04:10.72,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}也让归来变得更难。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.64,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}可他还是回到年终舞台，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.81,0:04:13.96,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}再次击败费德勒。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.57,0:04:41.74,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}十二冠的最后一座在布里斯班。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.67,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}伤病让他走了很多弯路，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.91,0:04:45.43,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}却没让他放弃回到球场。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.29,0:04:48.24,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}2026年10月1日，东京。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.12,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}最后一场巡回赛结束，
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.34,0:04:51.73,chapter-01_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}把最后的话留给他自己。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:53.85,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}ケガでこうやって
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.81,0:04:53.85,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}伤病让我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:57.07,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}何年も自分が失った中で
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.85,0:04:57.07,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}失去了多年的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:04:58.77,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}最後の最後まで
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:04:58.77,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}但直到最后的最后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.87,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}諦めずにプレーできた
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.29,0:05:00.87,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}我没有放弃，一直打球
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:01.61,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}っていうことが
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.87,0:05:01.61,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:04.78,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}自分の誇りかなと思います
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:04.78,real-ending-00-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}我想，这是我的骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.18,01-ja-zh_Japanese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1284)\fs42}本当にありがとうございました
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.52,0:05:10.18,01-ja-zh_Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an2\pos(540,1326)\fs49}真的非常感谢大家
